En el package.json del repo (AppVenturesMX/bienesraiceshub), dentro de "dependencies", agrega esta línea (junto a las que ya existen, respetando las comas):

    "@neondatabase/serverless": "^1.2.0",

Ejemplo de cómo debe quedar el bloque "dependencies" completo:

  "dependencies": {
    "@base-ui/react": "^1.5.0",
    "@fontsource/space-grotesk": "^5.3.0",
    "@neondatabase/serverless": "^1.2.0",
    "@vercel/analytics": "1.6.1",
    "class-variance-authority": "^0.7.1",
    "clsx": "^2.1.1",
    "framer-motion": "^13.4.0",
    "lucide-react": "^1.16.0",
    "next": "16.3.3",
    "react": "^19",
    "react-dom": "^19",
    "shadcn": "^4.11.0",
    "tailwind-merge": "^3.3.1",
    "tw-animate-css": "^1.4.0"
  },
